  "question": {
    "text": "Consider the following bromides :\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/labcWmUGy05BucAllMFGm5URvjsuZWIKYQ7DrHA4Nbg.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\nThe correct order of $\\mathrm{S}_{\\mathrm{N}} 1$ reactivity is",
