  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\mathrm{S}_{\\mathrm{N}} 1$ proceeds via carbocation intermediate, the most stable one forming the product faster. Hence reactivity order for $\\mathrm{A}, \\mathrm{B}, \\mathrm{C}$ depends on stability of carbocation created.\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/b_7x78l58e8mpq6u5_deqWwqQCOsDj-uOEvfE32OjjY.original.fullsize.png\"><br>",
